	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(35.0, 15.0, 325.0, 52.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 1: AUDIT KUALITAS AWAL (2.776 baris)
Cek kelengkapan, rentang 12-24 Nov 2026 &amp; platform.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(265.0, 150.0, 215.0, 74.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 2: CLEANING &amp; NORMALISASI
NFKC, hapus UI X/stiker/URL/mention,
kamus slang (535) &amp; stopwords (776),
tandai berita/link X, duplikat &amp; spam.</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(500.0, 150.0, 220.0, 72.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 3: SARING DATA VALID
status_data is valid -&gt; 2.660 baris.
Cabang bawah (Unmatched) -&gt; 116 baris
terbuang agar transparan saat demo.</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(870.0, 15.0, 245.0, 52.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="11">TAHAP 4: VERIFIKASI &amp; EKSPOR
Pilih 10 kolom baku, bandingkan hasil,
dan ekspor data_bersih.csv (UTF-8).</text>
	</annotations>
